  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（21四川）某工程队计划每天修路560米，恰好可按期完成任务。如每天比计划多修80米，则可以提前2天完成，且最后1天只需修320米。问：如果要提前6天完成，每天至少要比计划多修多少米？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "160"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "240"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "320"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "400"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          58
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          52
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-01-p058.webp",
            "alt": "工程问题 · 实战精刷1 · 讲义第52页",
            "pdfPage": 58
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s05-t02-drill-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设计划工期T天。原总量560T；提速后前T－3天每天640米，最后一天320米，总用T－2天，所以640(T－3)＋320＝560T。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "解得T＝20，总路长11200米。提前6天意味着14天完成，每天至少11200÷14＝800米。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "要比原计划多800－560＝240米，选B。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "最后一天不足全天时要单列，提前天数比较的是实际结束的日期。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
